      "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
      "body": "Thanks for the contribution! Restoring packed `(T, H, D)` operand geometry while preserving storage aliases and poisoned capacity tails is a useful test fix. I've added this PR to our tracking and supplied the required category, area and external-origin labels.\n\nI see the exact-head GPU verification is already running, so I'll follow that result without starting a duplicate job. CPU view/alias checks and native binder/kernel validation remain separate evidence.\n\nWhen you're satisfied with the validation and the PR is ready, switch it from draft to **Ready for review**. The review bot will review it, and we'll help work through feedback, any remaining validation and integration through final merge. If it is already non-draft by then, a **ready** comment also lets us know.\n\n<!-- fe-external-watch:1718:initial:e6443926e62dde8fbce715f03e3f64928af44365 -->\n",
